      "message": "1. This function will disable bc12 detection, and I think no matter you are going to update the bc12 type or not, you should disable it.\n\n2. Just noticed that: pd_cacpable() uses the flag PD_FLAGS_PREVIOUS_PD_CONN, and it\u0027s updated while receiving SrcCap or the port partner replied Ack to SrcCap. There could be a gap between USB_CHG_EVENT_BC12 raised and the flag PD_FLAGS_PREVIOUS_PD_CONN update (that is, the evt is raised before the flag updated). I am not sure if this would be the best way to use pd_capable() here.",
